t":"ml","pantryKey":"vanilla","stepRef":2}]},{"title":"Flavor, Glaze & Finish","badge":"Signature Touch","tone":"primary","items":[{"id":"m53316_7","name":"Egg","baseAmount":3,"usUnit":"whole","metricAmount":3,"metricUnit":"whole","pantryKey":"eggs","stepRef":2},{"id":"m53316_8","name":"Butter","baseAmount":0.9,"usUnit":"oz","metricAmount":25,"metricUnit":"g","pantryKey":"butter","stepRef":2},{"id":"m53316_9","name":"Frozen Mixed Berries","baseAmount":0.89,"usUnit":"cup","metricAmount":200,"metricUnit":"g","pantryKey":"sugar","stepRef":2},{"id":"m53316_10","name":"Blackcurrant Jam","baseAmount":2,"usUnit":"tbsp","metricAmount":30,"metricUnit":"g","pantryKey":"sugar","stepRef":2},{"id":"m53316_11","name":"Greek Yogurt","baseAmount":6.7,"usUnit":"tbsp","metricAmount":100,"metricUnit":"g","pantryKey":"milk","stepRef":2}]}],"steps":[{"stepNumber":1,"phaseLabel":"Prep & Mix","title":"Whisk & Combine Base Ingredients","instructionTemplate":"Put the beetroot in a jug with the milk and blend with a stick blender until smooth. Pour into a bowl with the rest of the pancake ingredients and whisk until smooth and vibrant purple. Incorporate {m53316_1}, {m53316_2}, {m53316_3}, and {m53316_4} smoothly until evenly distributed.","durationMin":5,"timerSeconds":300,"activeMeasureSummary":"Beetroot, Milk","creatorSecret":"Prep and measure beetroot first—mise en place makes this dessert twice as fast."},{"stepNumber":2,"phaseLabel":"Build Flavor","title":"Fold In Flavorings & Mix-Ins","instructionTemplate":"Put a small knob of butter in a large non-stick frying pan and heat over a medium-low heat until melted and foamy. Now create 3 or 4 pancakes each made from 2 tbsp of the batter. Cook for 2-3 mins then flip over and cook for a further minute until cooked through. Repeat with any remaining batter. Heat oven to lowest setting and keep the pancakes warm in there until needed. Incorporate {m53316_5} and {m53316_6} smoothly until evenly distributed.","durationMin":5,"timerSeconds":300,"activeMeasureSummary":"Self-raising Flour, Baking Powder"},{"stepNumber":3,"phaseLabel":"Combine & Fold","title":"Combine Wet & Dry Smoothly","instructionTemplate":"Fold {m53316_7}, {m53316_8}, {m53316_9}, {m53316_10}, and {m53316_11} into the base in two additions using gentle strokes until glossy and uniform with zero dry pockets. Avoid overmixing so the final texture stays light and tender.","durationMin":3,"timerSeconds":180,"activeMeasureSummary":"Glossy Batter • Zero Lumps"},{"stepNumber":4,"phaseLabel":"Shape & Layer","title":"Drain Crisp, Garnish & Serve Warm","instructionTemplate":"Serve with your favourite pancake toppings or make a simple compote by simmering frozen berries in with 1 tbsp blackcurrant jam until bubbling and syrupy (about 5-10 mins). In a small bowl stir together the remaining jam and the yogurt. Stack the cooked pancakes with the yogurt and pour the warm berry compote over the top.","durationMin":18,"timerSeconds":1080,"activeMeasureSummary":"Maple Syrup, Vanilla Extract","criticalTip":"Let set for 5–10 minutes before slicing or plating so the textures hold crisp and photogenic!","creatorSecret":"Glaze or toss in sugar while still warm so the coating melts lightly and clings to every ridge."}],"ugcQuotes":[{"id":"muq-53316","handle":"@baker_beetroot","image":"./ai-images/beetroot-pancakes.jpg","quote":"Followed the scaled metric steps—came out flawless in 33 mins!","rating":5}],"isHealthy":true}}]
